{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Tom and Lisa in <strong>Hero World 2</strong>, a thrilling new adventure! Unlike the story driven first installment, this sequel focuses on helping the duo collect coins &amp; fruits while introducing numerous upgrades and fresh features.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key\u00a0Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expanded Wardrobe for Lisa:</strong> Lisa now has 6 outfits 3 more than in the first game for even more variety and customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Checkpoints:</strong> Say goodbye to restarting entire levels! New checkpoints let you pick up right where you left off after a misstep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Larger Levels:</strong> Explore bigger, more detailed levels packed with new challenges and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced Gameplay:</strong> Every mechanic has been polished to provide a smoother, more enjoyable experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fresh Content and Features:</strong> Discover all new elements that make each level more engaging and dynamic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>Hero World 2</strong> builds on the strengths of the first game, delivering an improved and expanded experience with exciting new challenges. Are you ready to join Tom and Lisa on their fruity adventure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i></i></strong><br><strong><i>Note:</i></strong><i> Playing the first Hero World can help you get to know the characters and gameplay better.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available on Steam</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":" Tutorial Mastered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3445550/dc6214ffe9e21d410c4d5fba2ad674c9aa2ce089.jpg"},{"name":"Not Seriously The First Death","path":"https://cdn.